@startuml
left to right direction

actor User
actor "API Caller" as Caller
actor "IMAP Server" as IMAP
actor "SMTP Server" as SMTP

rectangle "Email Client (current implementation)" {
  usecase "View sample inbox" as ViewInbox
  usecase "List remote mailboxes\n(sample API)" as ListMailboxes
  usecase "Send test email\n(sample API)" as SendEmail
}

User --> ViewInbox
Caller --> ListMailboxes
Caller --> SendEmail
ListMailboxes --> IMAP
SendEmail --> SMTP

note bottom of ViewInbox
  Inbox uses generated sample messages;
  live message retrieval is not implemented.
end note
@enduml
